@CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7025

### 1) Login as admin (returns a JWT — copy the token value)
POST {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "luka.popovic@cateringplanet.rs",
  "password": "Catering123!"
}

### 2) Public: get all menu categories
GET {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/menu/categories
Accept: application/json

### 3) Public: get visible foods (optional categoryId filter)
GET {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/menu/foods?categoryId=1
Accept: application/json

### 4) Public: get visible combos
GET {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/menu/combos
Accept: application/json

### 5) Authenticated: current user profile (replace TOKEN with the JWT from step 1)
GET {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 6) Authenticated: place an order
POST {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
  "lines": [
    { "itemId": 21, "isCombo": false, "amount": 2 },
    { "itemId": 1, "isCombo": true, "amount": 1 }
  ],
  "deliveryMethodId": 1,
  "paymentMethodId": 1,
  "discountId": null,
  "contactName": "Luka Popovic",
  "contactPhone": "0601234567",
  "deliveryLocation": "Bulevar kralja Aleksandra 10, Beograd"
}

### 7) Authenticated: my orders
GET {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 8) Admin: all orders (optionally filtered by statusId)
GET {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/orders?statusId=1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 9) Admin: update order status (any transition allowed)
PATCH {{CateringPlanet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
  "statusId": 3,
  "cancellationReason": null
}
